bmdctl/atem (a Go port of atemwire)

This package is a Go port of atemwire from bmdwire v1.3.0
(https://github.com/lucas-romanenko/bmdwire, tag v1.3.0, commit e5e336c).
atemwire is itself a fork of pyatem by Martijn Braam and the OpenAtem
contributors, https://git.sr.ht/~martijnbraam/pyatem, licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 only (LGPL-3.0-only).

The port follows atemwire's behaviour; where it differs, docs/PORTING.md
says how and why. It is released under the same LGPL-3.0-only licence. See
LICENSE (LGPL v3) and LICENSE-gpl3.txt (GPL v3, which the LGPL v3 text
incorporates by reference).

